(MERIDIAN MARITIME - WORKING HOURS AND OVERTIME POLICY) Tj T*
(Policy HR-204, effective 1 January 2026) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Standard working week) Tj T*
(The standard working week for shore staff is 40 hours, Monday to Friday, 08:30 to 17:00 with) Tj T*
(an unpaid 30 minute lunch break. Core hours, when everyone is expected to be available, are) Tj T*
(10:00 to 15:00. Staff who will arrive after 09:30 must inform their line manager.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Overtime) Tj T*
(Overtime must be approved in advance by the line manager. Unapproved overtime is not paid.) Tj T*
(Approved overtime is paid at 1.5 times the normal hourly rate on weekdays and at 2 times the) Tj T*
(normal hourly rate on Sundays and public holidays. No employee may work more than 10 hours) Tj T*
(of overtime in a single week.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Instead of payment, an employee may choose compensatory time off at a rate of one hour off) Tj T*
(for each overtime hour worked. Compensatory time off must be taken within 60 days of the) Tj T*
(overtime being worked.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Night work) Tj T*
(Hours worked between 22:00 and 06:00 attract a night premium of 20 percent on top of the) Tj T*
(normal hourly rate. The night premium and the overtime rate are not added together; the) Tj T*
(higher of the two applies.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. On-call duty) Tj T*
(Staff on the 24-hour operations rota receive an on-call allowance of 75 USD per week. If) Tj T*
(called out, the employee is paid for a minimum of 2 hours at the overtime rate, even if the) Tj T*
(work takes less time.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Remote working) Tj T*
(After completing probation, employees may work remotely up to 2 days per week with their) Tj T*
(line manager's agreement. Remote working days must be recorded in the HR portal by the end) Tj T*
(of the previous week. Roles that need physical presence in the operations room are not) Tj T*
(eligible for remote working.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Timesheets) Tj T*
(Timesheets must be submitted by the 25th of each month. Late timesheets are paid in the) Tj T*
(following month's payroll.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
